/* 零栋GO 设计系统（与商家端一致：蓝主色 #3078C0、12rpx 圆角+描边卡片、8rpx 矩形按钮） */

page {
  --brand: #3078C0;
  --brand-light: #DCE9F8;
  --brand-deep: #2166A8;
  --success: #00B578;
  --warning: #FFB000;
  --danger: #FA5151;
  --text-main: #111111;
  --text-sub: #666666;
  --text-weak: #999999;
  --bg-page: #FAFAFA;
  --bg-card: #FFFFFF;
  --line: #EBEBEB;
  --fill: #F5F5F5;
  --page-pad: 32rpx;
  --card-pad: 32rpx;
  --card-gap: 16rpx;
  --radius-sm: 8rpx;
  --radius-md: 12rpx;
  --radius-lg: 16rpx;
  --button-primary-background-color: var(--brand);
  --button-primary-border-color: var(--brand);
  --button-primary-background-color-active: #333333;
  --button-primary-border-color-active: #333333;
  --price-color: #111111;
  --tabbar-active-color: #111111;
  --tab-active-text-color: #111111;
  --search-field-background-color: #F5F5F5;

  background: var(--bg-page);
  font-size: 28rpx;
  color: var(--text-main);
  font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Helvetica Neue", Helvetica, "PingFang SC", "Hiragino Sans GB", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
  line-height: 1.5;
}

.page {
  padding: var(--page-pad);
  padding-bottom: 48rpx;
}

/* 顶部浅蓝渐变区（首页/确认订单/我的，对齐商家端 grad-banner） */
.sky-bg {
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, #E4F0FF 0%, #FAFAFA 60%);
}

.card {
  background: var(--bg-card);
  border: 1rpx solid var(--line);
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  padding: var(--card-pad);
  margin-bottom: var(--card-gap);
}

.section-title {
  font-size: 32rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--text-main);
  margin: 8rpx 0 20rpx;
}

/* 价格：品牌蓝强调（与购物车页一致） */
.price {
  color: var(--brand);
  font-weight: 600;
}

.price-symbol {
  font-size: 24rpx;
  margin-right: 2rpx;
}

.price-num {
  font-size: 36rpx;
}

.text-sub { color: var(--text-sub); }
.text-weak { color: var(--text-weak); }
.text-sm { font-size: 24rpx; }
.flex { display: flex; align-items: center; }
.flex-between { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
.flex-1 { flex: 1; }
.ellipsis {
  overflow: hidden;
  white-space: nowrap;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
}

/* 图片占满容器（容器需有尺寸与圆角） */
.fill-img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  border-radius: inherit;
  display: block;
}

.safe-bottom { padding-bottom: env(safe-area-inset-bottom); }

/* 底部操作栏：描边顶线（对齐商家端） */
.bottom-bar {
  position: fixed;
  left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
  background: var(--bg-card);
  border-top: 1rpx solid var(--line);
  padding: 16rpx var(--page-pad) calc(16rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  z-index: 10;
}

.placeholder { text-align: center; color: var(--text-weak); padding: 80rpx 0; }

/* ===== 自绘组件层（与商家端一致） ===== */
.btn {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  background: #3078C0;
  color: #ffffff;
  font-size: 28rpx;
  border-radius: 8rpx;
  padding: 0 32rpx;
  height: 80rpx;
  line-height: 1;
  border: none;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}
.btn::after { border: none; }
.btn-outline {
  background: #ffffff;
  color: #111111;
  border: 1rpx solid #CCCCCC;
}
.btn-sm { height: 60rpx; font-size: 26rpx; padding: 0 24rpx; border-radius: 6rpx; }
.btn-block { width: 100%; }
.btn-disabled { background: #D8D8D8; color: #ffffff; }
.btn-outline-brand { background: #ffffff; color: var(--brand); border: 1rpx solid var(--brand); }
.btn-hover { opacity: 0.82; }

.tag {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 4rpx 12rpx;
  font-size: 20rpx;
  border-radius: 4rpx;
  background: #F5F5F5;
  color: #666666;
}
.tag-dark { background: #3078C0; color: #ffffff; }
.tag-green { background: #E6F7EF; color: #00A56B; }
.tag-orange { background: #FFF3E8; color: #F5A623; }
.tag-blue { background: #EAF3FF; color: #3078C0; }
.tag-gray { background: #F5F5F5; color: #999999; }

/* 订单状态文字色（全端统一：不同状态不同颜色） */
.st-orange { color: #F5A623; }
.st-blue { color: #3078C0; }
.st-green { color: #2BA471; }
.st-red { color: #E64340; }
.st-gray { color: #999999; }

/* 统一搜索框 */
.search-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 20rpx;
  padding: 24rpx 24rpx 8rpx;
}
.search-box {
  flex: 1;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  background: #F3F4F6;
  border-radius: 12rpx;
  padding: 16rpx 24rpx;
}
.search-input {
  flex: 1;
  margin-left: 12rpx;
  font-size: 28rpx;
  color: #111111;
}
.search-ph { color: #999999; }

.cell {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 24rpx 0;
  border-bottom: 1rpx solid #F0F0F0;
}
.cell:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
.cell-label { font-size: 28rpx; color: #111111; flex-shrink: 0; margin-right: 24rpx; }
.cell-value { flex: 1; font-size: 28rpx; color: #666666; text-align: right; overflow: hidden; white-space: nowrap; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
.cell-arrow { color: #C0C0C0; margin-left: 8rpx; }

.field { display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 24rpx 0; border-bottom: 1rpx solid #F0F0F0; }
.field:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
.field-label { font-size: 28rpx; color: #111111; flex-shrink: 0; width: 160rpx; }
.field-input { flex: 1; font-size: 28rpx; color: #111111; text-align: right; }
.field-placeholder { color: #C0C0C0; }

.empty { text-align: center; padding: 120rpx 0 80rpx; }
.empty-icon { font-size: 72rpx; color: #D8D8D8; }
.empty-text { margin-top: 20rpx; font-size: 26rpx; color: #999999; }

/* 步进器（与商家端一致：方形灰底；保留 plus/disabled 变体兼容旧页面） */
.stepper { display: flex; align-items: center; }
.stepper-btn {
  width: 56rpx; height: 56rpx;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  background: #F5F5F5; color: #111111; font-size: 32rpx;
  border: none;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}
.stepper-btn.plus { background: #3078C0; color: #ffffff; }
.stepper-btn.disabled { background: #D8D8D8; color: #ffffff; }
.stepper-num { min-width: 72rpx; text-align: center; font-size: 28rpx; }

/* 公告条 */
.notice {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  background: var(--fill);
  padding: 16rpx 20rpx;
  font-size: 24rpx;
  color: #666666;
  border-radius: 8rpx;
}

/* 底部弹层 */
.popup-mask {
  position: fixed; inset: 0;
  background: rgba(0,0,0,0.45);
  z-index: 100;
}
.popup-sheet {
  position: fixed; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
  background: #ffffff;
  border-radius: 16rpx 16rpx 0 0;
  z-index: 101;
  padding: 40rpx 32rpx calc(40rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  max-height: 70vh;
  overflow-y: auto;
}
.popup-close {
  position: absolute; right: 24rpx; top: 24rpx;
  font-size: 40rpx; color: #C0C0C0; line-height: 1;
}

/* 横向 tabs（选中蓝字+蓝下划线） */
.nav {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  overflow-x: auto;
  white-space: nowrap;
  -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
}
.nav-item {
  flex-shrink: 0;
  padding: 20rpx 12rpx;
  margin-right: 28rpx;
  font-size: 28rpx;
  color: #666666;
  border-bottom: 4rpx solid transparent;
}
.nav-item.on {
  color: #3078C0;
  font-weight: 600;
  border-bottom-color: #3078C0;
}

/* 底部浮动购物栏（首页/商品页）：描边卡片化，保留轻微浮起阴影 */
.cart-bar {
  position: fixed;
  left: 24rpx; right: 24rpx; bottom: 24rpx;
  background: #ffffff;
  border: 1rpx solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 12rpx;
  box-shadow: 0 4rpx 12rpx rgba(17, 17, 17, 0.08);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 16rpx 16rpx 16rpx 20rpx;
  z-index: 9;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.cart-bar-icon {
  width: 88rpx; height: 88rpx;
  margin: 0 20rpx 0 0;
  background: var(--brand-light);
  border-radius: 8rpx;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  position: relative;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
.cart-bar-badge {
  position: absolute; top: -4rpx; right: -4rpx;
  min-width: 32rpx; height: 32rpx;
  border-radius: 16rpx;
  background: var(--danger);
  color: #ffffff;
  font-size: 20rpx;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  padding: 0 8rpx;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}
.cart-bar-info { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
.cart-bar-price { color: var(--brand); font-weight: 700; font-size: 34rpx; }
.cart-bar-old { text-decoration: line-through; }
.cart-bar-fee { font-size: 22rpx; color: #999999; }

/* 设计图扩展组件层（与商家端一致） */
.chip {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 16rpx 0;
  background: #F3F4F6;
  color: #333333;
  border-radius: 12rpx;
  font-size: 26rpx;
}
.chip.on {
  background: #3078C0;
  color: #ffffff;
  font-weight: 500;
}

.seg {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  background: #F3F4F6;
  border-radius: 999rpx;
  padding: 6rpx;
}
.seg-item {
  padding: 10rpx 32rpx;
  border-radius: 999rpx;
  font-size: 26rpx;
  color: #666666;
  line-height: 1.4;
}
.seg-item.on {
  background: #3078C0;
  color: #ffffff;
}

.grad-banner {
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, #9CCDF2 0%, #6FB2E7 40%, #EAF2FA 100%);
}

/* ===== 加购飞入动画（首页 / 商城共用，两处手感必须一致） =====
   小球：外层走 X（linear）+ 内层走 Y（ease-in），两条时间曲线不同 → 合成一条下坠弧线。
   时长必须与 utils/flyCart.js 的 DURATION 保持一致。 */
.fly-layer {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  z-index: 99;
}
.fly-x {
  position: absolute;
  transition: transform 520ms linear;
  will-change: transform;
}
.fly-y {
  transition: transform 520ms cubic-bezier(0.55, 0, 1, 0.45);
  will-change: transform;
}
.fly-ball {
  width: 32rpx;
  height: 32rpx;
  margin: -16rpx 0 0 -16rpx;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--brand);
  box-shadow: 0 4rpx 12rpx rgba(48, 120, 192, 0.45);
}

/* 落点反馈：购物车图标弹跳 + 角标跳动。
   两组类名交替（a/b），连点时类名变了动画才会重新播放。 */
.cart-bar-icon.bounce-a,
.cart-bar-icon.bounce-b {
  animation: cart-bounce 520ms cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);
}
.cart-bar-badge.badge-pop-a,
.cart-bar-badge.badge-pop-b {
  animation: badge-pop 520ms cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);
}
@keyframes cart-bounce {
  0% { transform: scale(1); }
  35% { transform: scale(0.86); }
  70% { transform: scale(1.12); }
  100% { transform: scale(1); }
}
@keyframes badge-pop {
  0% { transform: scale(1); }
  40% { transform: scale(1.45); }
  100% { transform: scale(1); }
}

/* 「+」按下反馈：两个页面共用同一个 hover 类 */
.add-btn-hover {
  transform: scale(0.86);
  opacity: 0.9;
}
